flowchart LR
  R[Root: canonical GPU0 lease and finite job] --> S[Process supervisor]
  A[Recipe reviewer: pristine author task defaults] --> S
  P[Runtime agent: normal Fast and HumanoidBench payloads] --> S
  S --> C[Unchanged author train.py in fresh output directory]
  C --> W[Original native worlds and FastTD3 learner]
  W --> O[Original checkpoints and offline W&B output]
  S --> E[Process-only receipt and stdout]
  O --> L[Observed partial returns and original recordings]
  E --> D[Independent review: logged physics warnings]
  D --> L
  O -. root terminal acceptance pending .-> V[Completed-run returns, videos and explicit limits]
  D -. full log review pending .-> V
  E -. canonical owned cleanup .-> R
